# #5837, the claimless advance: the split transfer and the receiver's close heads.
MODULE: TransferCostWitnessTransferRaisesSharedWatermark
TARGET: TransferCostWitness
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the transfer is appended unstamped and shared, as C4 has it today: every split raises the partition's shared watermark
PERTURBS: Straggler
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, lastU)]
    /\ ReportForeign(a)
    /\ ReportStale(a)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<durable, acked, floor, up, rp, mine, snapCov, snapRows, epochVars, handVars>>
    /\ UNCHANGED <<lastU, oldUsed, restarted, oldRejected, envVars, moveVars>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the transfer raises the shared watermark.
    /\ lastU' = next
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, next)]
    /\ ReportForeign(a)
    /\ ReportStale(a)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<durable, acked, floor, up, rp, mine, snapCov, snapRows, epochVars, handVars>>
    /\ UNCHANGED <<oldUsed, restarted, oldRejected, envVars, moveVars>>
--- END
